# The subtitle format this plugin writes

The neighbour. Nothing here breaks a rule, and a reader that refused every page
put in front of it would pass every leg above without this one.

This plugin writes SubRip, and nothing else, for the first release. Files carry
the `.srt` extension.

## What the files look like

    1
    00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
    First line.

    2
    00:00:01,500 --> 01:02:03,456
    Second line.
